---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { CALCULADORAS } from "../lib/calculadoras";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Calculadoras para casais"
  description="Calculadoras grátis para o dinheiro a dois: divisão de contas proporcional ao salário, reserva de emergência, custo do casamento e metas do casal."
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-12 sm:px-6">
    <nav aria-label="Trilha de navegação" class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
      <ol class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1">
        <li>
          <a href="/" class="rounded-lg transition-colors hover:text-pink-700 dark:hover:text-pink-300">Início</a>
        </li>
        <li aria-hidden="true">›</li>
        <li aria-current="page" class="text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-200">Calculadoras</li>
      </ol>
    </nav>

    <header class="mt-6 max-w-2xl">
      <h1 class="font-display text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 sm:text-4xl dark:text-white">Calculadoras para casais</h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">
        Cada uma faz a conta de um guia do blog com os números de vocês. Nada é
        salvo nem enviado: o cálculo acontece no seu navegador.
      </p>
    </header>

    <ul class="mt-10 grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2">
      {CALCULADORAS.map((c) => (
        <li class="group relative rounded-2xl border border-pink-200 bg-pink-50 p-6 transition-colors hover:border-pink-300 dark:border-pink-800/60 dark:bg-pink-900/15 dark:hover:border-pink-700">
          <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-gray-800 dark:text-white">
            <a
              href={c.href}
              class="rounded transition-colors after:absolute after:inset-0 after:content-[''] hover:text-pink-800 dark:hover:text-pink-200"
            >
              {c.titulo}
            </a>
          </h2>
          <p class="mt-2 leading-relaxed text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-200">{c.resumo}</p>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm font-semibold text-pink-800 group-hover:underline group-hover:underline-offset-2 dark:text-pink-200">
            Abrir a calculadora <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
          </p>
        </li>
      ))}
    </ul>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
